This repository is the one place Munarium client packages are built for release
and published from: the publishing workflow, the source allowlist and the
release planner. The clients themselves, their tests and their CI live with the
service they speak to, in iokaio/munarium (the Server client libraries) and
iokaio/munarium-matrix (the Matrix client libraries), each under the same
License. This repository holds no client source and publishes nothing of its
own.

The publishing credentials and trusted-publisher registrations the workflow uses
live in this repository's protected release environment and on the registries.
None of them is in the tree, and nothing in the tree grants a right to use them.

Munarium Enterprise is a separate, proprietary distribution built on Munarium
Server and Munarium Matrix. It is not published from here, and nothing here
grants any right to it.

